---
title:    "Observing Functional Logic Computations"
citation: "(PADL 2004)"
url:      "https://www.michaelhanus.de/papers/PADL04.html"
date:     2004-01-01 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
---
This paper describes the tool COOSy
to observe the results of computations in a Curry program.
COOSy is available as a
[Curry package](https://cpm.curry-lang.org/pkgs/coosy.html)
and integrated in the Curry implementation
[PAKCS](https://www.curry-lang.org/pakcs/ "Portland Aachen Kiel Curry System").